# Cloudflare Pages / Workers static assets.
#
# The prototype is a client-rendered SPA, so unknown paths still need to reach
# index.html and let the router answer with its own 404 surface instead of a
# bare platform error. Real static files (assets, favicon, brand images) are
# served from disk before these rules apply, so they are left alone.

/en                /index.html   200
/en/               /index.html   200
/*                 /index.html   200
